# LinguIA rules

## Product
- LinguIA proposes a teacher-deliverable online plan; it does not replace teaching.
- Levels: `starter` | `support` | `advance`.
- Lesson shell is mostly fixed; content is personalized over time.
- v1: static hub + onboarding draft plan + curriculum maps. Supabase comes later.

## Content
- Register reusable HTML apps in `curriculum/apps-registry.md`.
- Map apps to topic IDs in `curriculum/topics.md`.
- Prefer linking existing live apps before rebuilding.

## Honesty
- Generated plans are drafts for teacher review.
- Do not promise full automation of 50 topics on day one.
